    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/ba/Yumi_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240904183927\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Yumi Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"960\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Yumi Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Yumi_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/ba/Yumi_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240904183927\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eKurokage\u0027s Sucessor\u003c/b\u003e\nYumi (雪泉) is a playable character in the Senran Kagura series who made her debut in Senran Kagura: Shinovi Versus.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA third-year student and the leader of the Gessen Girls\u0027 Academy elite shinobi.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\"\u003eAppearance\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYumi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYumi is a fairly tall girl with pale skin, light blue eyes, medium dark gray hair and an overall average complexion. She uses to adorn her hair with a wide white ribbon tie with blue stripes on ends.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn her shinobi clothes, she wears a solid white furisode kimono that hangs off her shoulders and exposes a large amount of her chest. The outfit has a blue double-lined trim with a blue obi on the back. Yumi also wears white socks but no shoes, or lavender flip flops since Estival Versus.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\"\u003ePersonality\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYumi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYumi is described as a calm and serious girl, recognized as stubborn for sticking to her goals and ideals since Shinovi Versus. While she supposedly takes responsibility as the leader of the Gessen elites, she can be seen as gullible as Shiki could have her do pointless fitness exercises when they need to prepare for the Shinovi Masters tournament.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\"\u003eGallery\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYumi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Yumi_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:89px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Yumi_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Yumi S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (196 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:89px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d3/Yumi_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimite